-- 144: DRIVING ANTHEM — live build recorded as recordings/jam-20261004-1133.wav
-- (4:16, 97 MB, markers in the .markers.jsonl sidecar). Built live from 143 by
-- adding, layering and stripping over ~4 minutes:
--   0:06  start            melody + pad only
--   0:39  tech house riddim  4-on-floor kick, offbeat hats, offbeat dubsynth bass
--   1:23  drums heavier      layered + alternating clap/hat/hand patterns
--   2:00  hard kick         808bd*4 + synth sub kick, drums bus 1.0
--   2:34  breakdown         melody/bass OUT, breakbeat (breaks165, sliced+chopped)
--                            + double-time kick/snare/hats
--   2:46  breakdown harder   chop 16, snare, rumble sub
--   2:52  eased off          less hard, breakbeat intact
--   3:06  bring back         melody + pad over driving kick/bass/claps
--   3:40  ending             drums out, pad moves to Bm-G-D-A, melody softens
-- This file is the OUTRO state (the end the take landed on).
-- Melody (d7) — Toto "Africa" (1982) chorus; in key (A major / F#m). Syncopated
--   into double-time pairs, stut 6 0.6 0.5 here (was stut 4 during the build),
--   cutoff 3000 and release 1.6 to soften for the outro.
-- Pad (d9) — NEW progression for the ending: Bm-G-D-A as wide inversions across
--   octaves 3-5, heavily verbed (verbSend 0.45, size 0.85, verbT60 6).
-- Sections used earlier (as comments so the arc is reproducible):
--   dup  riser: d1 $ s "808bd*4" # gain 1.3 # shape 0.65 # hpf 34 # release 0.07
--   rid  hats:  d3 $ s "[~ hh]*4" # gain 0.5 # hpf 900 # pan 0.6
--   bass:       d5 $ note "~ fs1 ~ fs1 ~ fs1 ~ fs1" # s "dubsynth" # waveMix 0.45
--                 # cutoff 300 # fenv 1.2 # drive 0.55 # sustain 0.08 # lpf 1400
--   claps:      d2 $ s "<[~ realclaps ~ realclaps] …>" # n (choose [0,1,2,3])
--   break:      d3 $ chop 8 $ slice 8 "<0 2 4 6 1 3 5 7>" $ s "breaks165"
--   sub kick:   d11 $ note "fs0*4" # s "dubsynth" # waveMix 0.2 # cutoff 150
--                 # drive 0.95 # sustain 0.06
-- Master chain (sc/dub_master.scd) has glue comp + tape + limiter (Limiter.ar
--   0.79); drums/bass group aux sends are 0 (sc/routing.scd) = dry kick.
setcps 0.5

d1 $ silence

d2 $ silence

d3 $ silence

d4 $ silence

d5 $ silence

d6 $ silence

d7 $ stut 6 0.6 0.5 $ slow 8 $ note "<[b4 [e5 cs5] e5 b4 [e5 cs5] b4 [e5 cs5] b4 a4 [gs4 a4] ~ ~] [[cs5 e5] fs5 e5 [cs5 e5] fs5 e5 a4 [b4 cs5] e5 b4 [cs5 b4] ~ ~] [e5 [fs5 gs5] fs5 e5 [cs5 b4] cs5 [e5 fs5] e5 cs5 b4 [a4 gs4] ~ ~] [b4 [e5 cs5] e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 [e5 cs5] b4 a4 ~ ~ ~ ~]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 0.9 # cutoff 3000 # release 1.6 # verbSend 0.2 # ddSend 0

d8 $ silence

d9 $ slow 2 $ n "<[b3,d5,fs5] [g3,b4,d5] [d3,fs4,a4] [a3,e4,cs5]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 1.05 # cutoff 3400 # attack 0.08 # sustain 4 # release 3.0 # verbSend 0.45 # room 0.7 # size 0.85 # verbT60 6 # verbDamp 0.4 # ddSend 0

d10 $ silence

d11 $ silence

d12 $ silence
